cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library or design framework, please cite the manuscript."
title: "A genome-verified CRISPR knockout library and design framework for dissecting acellular cementum regeneration"
abstract: "Design, genome-wide off-target verification and in silico characterisation of a 9,631-oligonucleotide pooled CRISPR knockout library targeting the cementogenic programme and the human kinome. The screen has not been executed; all reported quantities are computational properties of the design."
keywords:
  - acellular cementum
  - periodontal regeneration
  - CRISPR knockout screen
  - guide RNA design
  - off-target analysis
  - graph neural network
